## Python (huge local venvs/caches -- images install fresh via pip)
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.egg-info/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/htmlcov/
**/.coverage

## Node / Next.js (frontend image builds with its own context + .dockerignore)
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/.next/
frontend/coverage/
frontend/playwright-report/
frontend/test-results/

## VCS / editor / env
.git/
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
.env
.env.local
*.env.*.local

## Never ship local dev media/storage into an image
data/
storage/
media/
